GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users


### ============================================
### ============================================
### PLAYLISTS API (For Week 6 PUT & DELETE)
### ============================================
### ============================================

### 6. Get all playlists (Success 200)
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists

### 7. Get playlist by ID (Success 200) - Jazz Playlist
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/6ad1a123a6238671da0fb676

### 8. Create playlist (Success 201)
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reggae Vibes",
  "description": "Positive vibrations for sunny days",
  "creator": "Jesus Tortolero",
  "genre": "reggae",
  "songs": ["No Woman, No Cry", "Three Little Birds"],
  "isPublic": true,
  "coverImage": "https://picsum.photos/400/400?random=5"
}

### 9. Update playlist (Success 200) - Updating Jazz Playlist
PUT https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/6ad1a123a6238671da0fb676
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jazz for Studying - Masterpiece Edition"
}

### 10. Update playlist (Error 400 Validation) - Invalid genre
PUT https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/6ad1a123a6238671da0fb676
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "genre": "heavy-metal" 
}

### 11. Delete playlist (Success 200) - Deleting "My Awesome Playlist"
DELETE https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/6ad6cc95ca7403d6e432f500

### 12. Delete playlist (Error 404) - Non-existent ID
DELETE https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/playlists/000000000000000000000000